  "summary": "先贤描写天同温和、机智、文墨精通，同时另有庙旺与陷地不同的描述。作者以水随环境调整并达平衡的静态特质解释随和、谦逊及少激动，进而提出长寿的命理解释；这不是确证的健康结论，原文高番、火富等疑字保留。",
  "summary_en": "Classical accounts describe Tian Tong as gentle, resourceful and literate, while distinguishing favorable and weak placements. The author compares Water’s capacity to adjust to its surroundings and settle into equilibrium with an accommodating, modest and less excitable temperament. A proposed connection with longevity remains the author’s astrological explanation, not an established health conclusion. Uncertain characters in the quoted accounts of status and wealth are retained.",
